          "urpx:description": "Voluntary residential TOU schedule with summer/winter peak (4-9 p.m. all days) and off-peak periods. Customers pay a daily base services charge that varies by income tier (CARE / FERA / standard). Baseline credit and Conservation Incentive Adjustment apply per the 10-territory × 2-code × 2-season baseline-allowance matrix and are modeled in the sibling RatePlanModifier file `rate-plan-modifier_pge_e-tou-c-baseline-tier_2026-03-01.jsonld` (full 40-cell matrix, 20 ServiceTiers each referencing a per-cell ProfileAlternative). Vintage PCIA for CCA/DA/TBS customers is modeled as a sibling RatePlanModifier in this file.",
          "urpx:effectiveDateTime": "2026-03-01T00:00:00",
          "urpx:changeReason": {
            "@id": "urpx:rateCase"
          },
          "urpx:priceCurrency": "USD",
          "urpx:commodity": {
            "@id": "urpx:electricity"
          },
