              "urpx:description": "All plan elements and prices of Schedule E-TOU-C effective 2026-03-01 are carried inline from the published tariff sheets, including the TOU generation and distribution prices, the adjustment prices, the income-tier base services charge price sets, and the California Climate Credit. No component is priced externally, so the version is self-contained."
